{"1162660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCAV", "steam_appid": 1162660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ESCAPE THE APOCALYPTIC WASTELAND]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/7e3b67b2d46d829a01021b0d4d1edf03.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/7e3b67b2d46d829a01021b0d4d1edf03.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/7e3b67b2d46d829a01021b0d4d1edf03.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ether mining ruined the planet - poisoning the skies and driving the last survivors underground. Now the surface is overrun by mutated horrors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your truck and fight your way through the wasteland to escape the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[DRIFT AND DESTROY]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/cb47f41146746e8a65cbeeec1d5e0be5.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/cb47f41146746e8a65cbeeec1d5e0be5.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/cb47f41146746e8a65cbeeec1d5e0be5.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost, drift and blast through alien wastelands in fast-paced third-person vehicular combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on the move, weave through chaos, and tear through swarms of monsters with guns, momentum, and aggressive driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[OPTIMIZE TO SURVIVE]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/3aa836cac727df2152e5bc1b342d57b8.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/3aa836cac727df2152e5bc1b342d57b8.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/3aa836cac727df2152e5bc1b342d57b8.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is shaped by the items you choose and their powerful effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every inch of space matters. Rotate, rearrange, agonizingly optimize your inventory to create outrageous synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[PUSH YOUR LUCK]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/5ae1337890232e96ac793538387106c9.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/5ae1337890232e96ac793538387106c9.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/5ae1337890232e96ac793538387106c9.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world grows stronger the longer you survive. Do you hunt for more loot, or escape before you're overwhelmed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger every stage to prepare for the final boss before the wasteland consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ESCAPE THE APOCALYPTIC WASTELAND]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/7e3b67b2d46d829a01021b0d4d1edf03.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/7e3b67b2d46d829a01021b0d4d1edf03.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/7e3b67b2d46d829a01021b0d4d1edf03.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ether mining ruined the planet - poisoning the skies and driving the last survivors underground. Now the surface is overrun by mutated horrors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your truck and fight your way through the wasteland to escape the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[DRIFT AND DESTROY]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/cb47f41146746e8a65cbeeec1d5e0be5.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/cb47f41146746e8a65cbeeec1d5e0be5.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/cb47f41146746e8a65cbeeec1d5e0be5.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost, drift and blast through alien wastelands in fast-paced third-person vehicular combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on the move, weave through chaos, and tear through swarms of monsters with guns, momentum, and aggressive driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[OPTIMIZE TO SURVIVE]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/3aa836cac727df2152e5bc1b342d57b8.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/3aa836cac727df2152e5bc1b342d57b8.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/3aa836cac727df2152e5bc1b342d57b8.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is shaped by the items you choose and their powerful effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every inch of space matters. Rotate, rearrange, agonizingly optimize your inventory to create outrageous synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[PUSH YOUR LUCK]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/5ae1337890232e96ac793538387106c9.poster.avif?t=1775570153\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/5ae1337890232e96ac793538387106c9.webm?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/5ae1337890232e96ac793538387106c9.mp4?t=1775570153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world grows stronger the longer you survive. Do you hunt for more loot, or escape before you're overwhelmed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger every stage to prepare for the final boss before the wasteland consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "SCAV is a high-speed vehicular action-roguelite where you drift, boost and blast through swarms of mutated monsters, stack powerful item synergies, and escape a deadly alien planet.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“What makes SCAV interesting to me is that I’m not fighting other vehicles. Instead, it’s a Helldivers situation, where I’m fighting big-ass bugs and other creepy crawlies. Twisted Metal meets Earth Defense Force? I’m all in.”<br>Glizzy<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/4bc7020c8e3e7f75977133d2e1ec98a3cbde316e/header.jpg?t=1775570153", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/d3895e19a215a7bdcc7509c13614283f5f55bf45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775570153", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/d3895e19a215a7bdcc7509c13614283f5f55bf45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775570153", "website": "https://manicgames.com.au", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "rec